When Norma has 5 stacks of <color=#FFFFFF>Combo</color>, she gains the following effect:
The Interrupt Level of <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter</color> is increased;
After unleashing her <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to immediately chain into the 4th strike of <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Engineering Insurance</color>;
After unleashing the 4th hit of her <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Engineering Insurance</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to immediately chain into <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color>;
DMG dealt by Norma <color=#2BAD00>ignores 35% of the target's DEF</color>.
